  "baseRevision": "70548de36891735e4f57029e17b19a619ce12bed",
  "scope": "Mac native Auto fit ordering, actual completion joining and upload retirement; performance qualification remains open",
  "changes": [
    "The first cold provisional fit completes before native preparation is requested; current generation/cancellation is checked after the await.",
    "Concurrent driver requests join the same provisional fit task; completion is published only after the session actor returns.",
    "Retirement cancels and joins the actual fit before closing the old GPU session or allocating a replacement upload; queued canceled fits do not start FFI.",
    "Already running provisional FFI is not interruptible; joining preserves resource ownership until its actual return.",
    "No color math, quality policy, Rust/WGSL/ABI/XMP schema, model or threshold changes. Native Auto artifact identity and all measured frame digests remain unchanged."
  ],
